; XRepeat (VRF core): <8 x i32>/<8 x float> live in 8 consecutive F registers
; starting at f0, f8, f16 or f24, and <16 x i32>/<16 x float> in 16 starting at
; f0 or f16. Loads and stores are FLW/FSW + REPEAT (stride 4 in an x register),
; copies xr.addi vd, vs, 0 + REPEAT, and spills one FLW/FSW per element.
; Arithmetic is tested in xrepeat-vrf-ops.ll.

define void @copy8i(ptr %a, ptr %b) {
